WINTER RESONANCE III marks the annual convergence — a gathering of collectives, artists, and communities from around the world united by a shared vision for sound and experience. This collaboration brings together hypnotic techno’s brightest voices, building something greater than the sum of its parts.

Leading the night in the Main Room, we welcome @lewisfautzi, @temudo_hayes, and @elledeenyc.
Room 2 brings together the collectives with showcases from @impulsecontrol.newyork, @solace_ny, @circuitstructurerecords, and @qs1berlin, supported by:

